@startuml invoicing-database-diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam linetype ortho

!define collection(x) entity x << (C,#438DD5) Collection >>
!define embedded(x)   entity x << (E,#85BBF0) Embedded >>
!define enum(x)       entity x << (N,#B8C4CE) Enum >>

hide circle
hide empty members

title Vankoo Invoicing — Document Data Model (MongoDB)

collection(Invoices) {
  * _id                       : ObjectId (InvoiceId VO) <<PK>>
  --
  * MypeId                    : STRING <<ref IAM.users.id (via Profile.companies)>>
  * Status                    : STRING (InvoiceStatus)
  * IssuerData                : EMBEDDED (IssuerData)
  * PayerData                 : EMBEDDED (PayerData)
  * Document                  : EMBEDDED (InvoiceDocument)
  * Metadata                  : EMBEDDED (InvoiceMetadata)
  * SunatValidation           : EMBEDDED (SunatValidation)
  * SunatVerificationStatus   : STRING
  * ConsistencyResult         : EMBEDDED (InvoiceConsistencyResult)
  * IntegrationEventPublicationStatus : STRING
  * Items                     : ARRAY<InvoiceLineItem>
  * TotalAmount                : EMBEDDED (Money)
  * SubtotalAmount             : EMBEDDED (Money)
  * TaxAmount                  : EMBEDDED (Money)
  * DiscountAmount             : EMBEDDED (Money)
  * RejectionReason           : EMBEDDED (RejectionReason)
  * OcrOperationId             : STRING
  * CreatedAt / UpdatedAt      : ISODate
}

collection(OcrTasks) {
  * _id                       : STRING (OcrTask.Id, GUID plano) <<PK>>
  --
  * InvoiceId                 : STRING <<UNIQUE>>
  * Status                    : STRING (OcrTaskStatus)
  * AttemptCount               : INT32
  * MaxAttempts                : INT32
  * NextRetryAtUtc             : ISODate
  * LockExpiresAtUtc           : ISODate (nullable)
  * LastError                  : STRING (nullable)
  * CreatedAtUtc / UpdatedAtUtc : ISODate
}

embedded(IssuerData) {
  * Ruc          : STRING (RucNumber)
  * LegalName    : STRING
  * TradeName    : STRING
  * Address      : STRING
}

embedded(PayerData) {
  * Ruc          : STRING (RucNumber)
  * LegalName    : STRING
  * TradeName    : STRING
  * Address      : STRING
}

embedded(InvoiceDocument) {
  * Key            : STRING (FileKey)
  * OriginalName   : STRING
  * ContentType    : STRING
  * FileSizeBytes  : INT64
  * ContentHash    : STRING
}

embedded(InvoiceMetadata) {
  * InvoiceSeries  : STRING
  * InvoiceNumber  : STRING
  * IssueDate      : ISODate
  * DueDate        : ISODate
  * Currency       : STRING
  * OcrConfidence  : DOUBLE
}

embedded(SunatValidation) {
  * IsValid        : BOOLEAN
  * ValidatedAt    : ISODate (nullable)
  * CdrUrl         : STRING (nullable)
  * ResponseCode   : STRING (nullable)
}

embedded(InvoiceConsistencyResult) {
  * Status       : STRING
  * Issues       : ARRAY<InvoiceValidationIssue>
  * CheckedAt    : ISODate (nullable)
}

embedded(InvoiceValidationIssue) {
  * Code       : STRING
  * Severity   : STRING
  * Message    : STRING
}

embedded(RejectionReason) {
  * Reason       : STRING
  * RejectedAt   : ISODate
  * RejectedBy   : STRING (nullable)
}

embedded(InvoiceLineItem) {
  * Description  : STRING
  * Quantity     : DECIMAL128
  * UnitPrice    : EMBEDDED (Money)
  * Subtotal     : EMBEDDED (Money)
}

embedded(Money) {
  * Amount     : DECIMAL128
  * Currency   : STRING
}

Invoices ||--o| IssuerData : embeds
Invoices ||--o| PayerData : embeds
Invoices ||--|| InvoiceDocument : embeds
Invoices ||--o| InvoiceMetadata : embeds
Invoices ||--o| SunatValidation : embeds
Invoices ||--|| InvoiceConsistencyResult : embeds
InvoiceConsistencyResult ||--o{ InvoiceValidationIssue : embeds
Invoices ||--o| RejectionReason : embeds
Invoices ||--o{ InvoiceLineItem : embeds
Invoices ||--o{ Money : "embeds (Total/Subtotal/Tax/Discount)"
InvoiceLineItem ||--o{ Money : "embeds (UnitPrice/Subtotal)"

OcrTasks }o..o{ Invoices : "references by InvoiceId (string, misma BD, colección distinta)"

note bottom of Invoices
  Índices secundarios: NINGUNO definido en el código (hallazgo real,
  no omisión del reporte) — ni siquiera sobre Document.ContentHash o
  IssuerData.Ruc + Metadata.InvoiceSeries/InvoiceNumber, pese a usarse
  en ExistsByContentHashAsync/ExistsByFiscalIdentityAsync.
  Shard Key / Partition Key: no definida (sin shardCollection en el
  código ni en scripts de infraestructura revisados).
  TTL index: no definido.
  El documento persistido ES la clase de dominio Invoice (sin
  BsonElement/BsonClassMap ni modelo de persistencia separado); el
  driver de Mongo mapea por convención de nombre de propiedad C#.
end note

note bottom of OcrTasks
  Índices secundarios:
  - { Status: 1, NextRetryAtUtc: 1 } ("byStatusAndRetry")
  - { LockExpiresAtUtc: 1 } ("byLockExpire")
  - UNIQUE { InvoiceId: 1 } ("uniqueByInvoice")
  Shard Key / Partition Key: no definida.
  TTL index: no definido.
  Cola de reintentos con lease: ClaimNextAsync usa
  FindOneAndUpdateAsync atómico sobre tareas Pending vencidas o
  Processing con lock expirado.
end note

legend bottom
  Invoices.MypeId referencia lógicamente (sin FK/ref físico de Mongo)
  al UserId de IAM propagado a través de companies.user_id en Profile.
  La integración con otros Bounded Contexts (Investment, Risk,
  Notification, Audit) ocurre vía Integration Events sobre Kafka
  (topic invoicing.invoice-eligible-for-funding), no vía referencias
  embebidas ni joins de Mongo.
end legend

@enduml
